ADDITIONAL INFORMATION

iNaturalist Import - QGIS Plugin
A tool for importing and enriching biodiversity data from iNaturalist

Repository: https://github.com/yd73/iNaturalist_Import
Author: Yves Durivault
Contact: yves.durivault@gmail.com

This plugin uses:
- pyinaturalist library (MIT License)
- iNaturalist API (https://www.inaturalist.org)
- QGIS API (GPL v2+)
